{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Primal Survival Wars</strong> is an open-world survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will lead a tribe of early humans and guide them through millennia, helping them survive, develop, and evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your journey in the Stone Age and progress through human development to the Iron Age, spanning over 10,000 years of history.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become a wise leader:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ensure the survival of your people:\u00a0Hunt mammoths, woolly rhinos, and other prehistoric creatures, gather resources, craft tools, and build shelters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/Hunt.gif?t=1742587599\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Develop technology:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hone your crafting skills, make discoveries, and explore new territories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expand and protect your settlement:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build new homes, fortifications, and weapons to help your people grow and thrive, and to prevent enemies from catching you off guard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/Attack.gif?t=1742587599\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hunt, set traps for animals:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/Hunt2.gif?t=1742587599\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tame wild animals:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness nature, master farming techniques, and tame loyal helpers who will provide you with food and resources.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather resources:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wood, stone, ore, animal skins, bones, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/CutTree.gif?t=1742587599\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft tools:\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Axes, picks, knives, spears, bows and arrows - everything you need for hunting, building, and defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/extras/Build.gif?t=1742587599\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Additional details:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a variety of environments, from lush forests to arid deserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can choose from a variety of tribes, each with its own unique strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a deep research system that allows players to unlock new technologies and abilities.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2941520?t=1742587599","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742587599","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742587599","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742587599","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Primal Survival Wars</strong> is an open-world survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will lead a tribe of early humans and guide them through millennia, helping them survive, develop, and e